/-!
# SpecTec

The WebAssembly specification DSL, and the S-expression stream its frontend
prints with `--ast`, formalized at `WebAssembly/spec` revision
`608711107b7f1edb13efd57b7d79b49477462d36`.  `docs/projects/spectec/README.md` describes the
layering and what the printer erases; `specs/spectec/` holds the pinned
streams.
-/
